# .aiexclude — Gemini Code Assist (IDE chat, agent mode, code completion, Enterprise indexing)
# Syntax follows .gitignore. Files matched here are never sent as context.

# --- Secrets and credentials (Constitution VI) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/appsettings.*.local.json

# --- Build output and dependencies (noise, wasted tokens) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/playwright-report/
web/test-results/

# --- Generated / binary ---
*.log
*.zip
